# BLS registration key — OPTIONAL.
#
# Without one the app still works: it falls back to the unregistered tier,
# which allows 25 requests/day counted per IP. That is enough for one person
# and not enough for a table, because the price cache is per browser and each
# refresh spends six requests.
#
# With one, the limit is 500/day counted per key.
#
# Get a key (free, instant, email only): https://data.bls.gov/registrationEngine/
# Then copy this file to .env.local and paste the key below.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# .env.local is gitignored. Do not commit the key — this repo is public.
# Note that Vite inlines VITE_* variables at build time, so the key is readable
# in the deployed bundle regardless. That is fine for BLS (no billing, no
# private data) but do not put a real secret here.

VITE_BLS_KEY=
